{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20785","headline":"叹昨日三首 二 · 卢仝","name":"叹昨日三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天下薄夫苦耽酒，玉川先生也耽酒。\n薄夫有钱恣张乐，先生无钱养恬漠。\n有钱无钱俱可怜，百年骤过如流川。\n平生心事消散尽，天上白日悠悠悬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20785.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20785","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}